  "description": "One wrong wish and now I have two husbands?! \n\nAfter finding a wish-granting statue, Renea jumps at the chance to turn her love life around. However, what was supposed to be a wish to make her cheating husband fall in love with her ends up as a wish to marry the hunky statue instead! Can Renea pull off having two husbands without getting caught? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
